# Static asset caching (INTEGRATION.md §8). Vite emits content-hashed file names under /assets/,
# so they can be cached forever. index.html and other files keep the default (revalidate).
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Anti-clickjacking for every page (Launch / Buy / Claim must never be framed by another site; the devnet test wallet
# signs in-page). Only frame-ancestors is set, so Google Maps, fonts and wallets are unaffected. HSTS keeps browsers on
# https for a year. The Worker sets the same headers on the /c/ and /p/ share pages (worker/share.ts
# PAGE_SECURITY_HEADERS).
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
